ll,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[14,10,56,67,64,22],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007802","armor":"WP1016505","helmet":"WP1025105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1063","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[14,10,56,67,64,22],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007802","armor":"WP1016505","helmet":"WP1025105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1063","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[14,10,56,67,64,22],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007802","armor":"WP1016505","helmet":"WP1025105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10180","city":"CS1063","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[14,10,56,67,64,22],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007802","armor":"WP1016505","helmet":"WP1025105"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[{"kind":"plot","id":"1005417","name":{"zh":"义救卢公","en":"Righteous Rescue of Lord Lu"},"year":"186","month":"1","desc":{"zh":"黄巾之乱时，卢植围攻张角，左丰索贿不成，诬其“惰慢军心”，卢植被罢官下狱。乱平后卢植仍陷囹圄，刘备决意营救恩师。\n\n触发条件：刘备、关羽、张飞、简雍、卢植、皇甫嵩、朱儁、汉灵帝、何进、十常侍、袁绍存活且在正确势力。\n\n禁忌条件：主角为卢植、皇甫嵩、朱儁、何进、十常侍时无法触发\n\n亲历条件：【与刘备关系等级大于等于2】。\n\n","en":"During the Yellow Turban Rebellion, Lu Zhi besieged Zhang Jiao. When Zuo Feng failed to extort a bribe from him, he falsely accused Lu Zhi of ‘slackness and undermining army morale,’ leading to Lu Zhi being stripped of his post and imprisoned. Even after the rebellion was quelled, Lu Zhi remained behind bars, and Liu Bei resolved to rescue his former mentor.\n\n\n\nTrigger Condition: Liu Bei, Guan Yu, Zhang Fei, Jian Yong, Lu Zhi, Huangfu Song, Zhu Jun, Emperor Ling of Han, He Jin, the Ten Attendants, and Yuan Shao are alive and in the correct Factions.\n\n\n\nIneligible Conditions: Cannot trigger if the protagonist is Lu Zhi, Huangfu Song, Zhu Jun, He Jin, or one of the Ten Attendants\n\n\n\nParticipation Requirement: 【Relationship level with Liu Bei is at least Level 2】.\n\n\n\n"}},{"kind":"plot","id":"1001319","name":{"zh":"怒笞督邮","en":"Lashing the Inspector"},"year":"188","month":"1","desc":{"zh":"忍辱行贿？或随翼德挥拳？为刘备得官道贺，却遇贪污行贿之事......\n\n禁忌条件：主角为张让，段珪时无法触发。\n\n亲历条件：【与刘备关系等级大于2级或作为刘备、关羽、张飞】","en":"Endure the humiliation and offer a bribe? Or throw punches alongside Yide? Arriving to congratulate Liu Bei on his appointment, only to encounter corrupt extortion...\n\n\n\nForbidden Condition: Cannot trigger if the protagonist is Zhang Rang or Duan Gui.\n\n\n\nParticipation Requirement: 【Relationship level with Liu Bei is greater than Level 2, or play as Liu Bei, Guan Yu, or Zhang Fei】"}}],"biography":{"zh":"汉末宦官，与张让等人狼狈为奸，共称十常侍。灵帝年间，段珪又多次参与祸乱朝廷的重大政治事件。与众宦官谋害朝廷大将军何进后，被袁绍、曹操入宫斩杀。","tc":"漢末宦官，與張讓等人狼狽為奸，共稱十常侍。靈帝年間，段珪又多次參與禍亂朝廷的重大政治事件。與眾宦官謀害朝廷大將軍何進后，被袁紹、曹操入宮斬殺。","en":"A eunuch of the late Han dynasty who colluded with Zhang Rang and others, together known as the Ten Attendants. During the reign of Emperor Ling, Duan Gui repeatedly took part in major political upheavals that brought turmoil to the court. After conspiring with the other eunuchs to assassinate Grand General He Jin, he was slain when Yuan Shao and Cao Cao stormed the palace.","jp":"後漢末期の宦官。張譲らと結託して悪事を働き、共に「十常侍」と称された。霊帝の時代、朝廷を混乱に陥れる数々の重大な政治事件に関与した。宦官たちと共に朝廷の大将軍・何進を謀殺したが、宮中に討ち入った袁紹や曹操らに斬殺された。","kr":"후한 말의 환관으로, 장양 등과 늑대와 이리처럼 결탁하여 함께 십상시라 불렸다. 영제 연간에 단규는 조정을 어지럽히는 중대한 정치 사건에 수차례 관여했다. 여러 환관과 함께 조정의 대장군 하진을 시해한 후, 궁궐로 진입한 원소와 조조에게 참살당했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10873","remark":"","surname":"段","surnameTc":"段","surnameE